WEBVTT

01:41.400 --> 01:42.240
Yurong.

01:43.920 --> 01:44.800
Goodness,

01:44.880 --> 01:45.800
why are you telling us

01:45.880 --> 01:48.360
to pack up and go back
to our hometown for no reason?

01:48.440 --> 01:49.760
Just lay low for a while.

01:50.280 --> 01:52.280
Tell people you're going back
to manage the family estate.

01:52.360 --> 01:53.320
Besides me,

01:53.400 --> 01:54.880
don't have any contact with anyone.

01:54.960 --> 01:57.000
Yurong, what exactly happened?

01:57.080 --> 01:58.600
Just do as I say.

01:58.680 --> 02:00.360
Our hometown is remote and poor.

02:00.440 --> 02:01.880
We'll suffer by going back.

02:01.960 --> 02:03.920
And you're not even telling us
what's going on.

02:04.600 --> 02:07.200
Do you look down on us
and want to drive us away?

02:07.280 --> 02:09.280
Do you want to know
what's happening in the capital?

02:09.759 --> 02:12.320
I'll dare to say it,
but would you dare to listen?

02:15.480 --> 02:16.360
Yurong, you…

02:17.840 --> 02:20.680
Since you won't tell us, it's fine.

02:21.960 --> 02:23.680
Your sister and I
will pack our things now.

02:23.760 --> 02:25.120
- Mother…
- By the way,

02:25.880 --> 02:28.480
be careful here.

02:29.160 --> 02:30.440
Come on. Let's go.

02:30.520 --> 02:31.520
Mother…

02:31.600 --> 02:32.480
Hurry up.

03:00.840 --> 03:01.760
So arrogant!

03:01.840 --> 03:05.840
GOVERN PEOPLE, SERVE THE HEAVENS

03:07.360 --> 03:09.680
FROM ZHAO SHENG: I WISH TO PRESENT
CAPTIVES FROM OUR RECENT VICTORY

03:09.760 --> 03:12.160
Prince Cheng is bringing
so many troops back to the capital.

03:12.960 --> 03:14.760
Is he planning to rebel?

03:16.200 --> 03:17.560
This memorial is well written.

03:17.640 --> 03:19.160
He's using the captives offering ritual

03:19.240 --> 03:22.080
to increase the number
of troops escorting them.

03:22.960 --> 03:23.800
It's reasonable.

03:24.320 --> 03:25.480
Your Majesty must approve it.

03:27.120 --> 03:28.840
But this doesn't seem like a plan

03:28.920 --> 03:30.120
Prince Cheng and the Eldest Princess
could come up with.

03:30.200 --> 03:31.480
There's a mastermind behind them?

03:31.560 --> 03:32.640
It's hard to say.

03:32.720 --> 03:34.760
Whether I approve this or not
is another matter.

03:35.760 --> 03:36.720
According to the report,

03:36.800 --> 03:38.840
Prince Cheng's troops
are already on the way here.

03:38.920 --> 03:41.000
Are we just letting them march back
to the capital

03:41.080 --> 03:43.000
and camp their troops outside the capital?

03:43.080 --> 03:45.520
Should we strike first

03:45.600 --> 03:48.720
and capture Prince Cheng
during the grand worship ceremony?

03:48.800 --> 03:49.840
We can't do that.

03:50.320 --> 03:51.240
If we do,

03:51.320 --> 03:52.360
His Majesty will be accused

03:52.440 --> 03:54.160
of persecuting loyal officials
and generals.

03:54.240 --> 03:56.400
Prince Cheng's troops
are just outside the capital.

03:56.960 --> 03:59.440
When the time comes,
the capital will be in chaos.

04:00.400 --> 04:02.160
The Imperial Court
might be in turmoil too.

04:02.240 --> 04:04.200
Are we just going
to stand by and do nothing?

04:08.720 --> 04:11.240
FIVE DAYS LATER

04:26.480 --> 04:27.360
Vice Director Ye,

04:27.440 --> 04:28.360
please check

04:29.040 --> 04:30.520
to see if we missed anything.

04:33.560 --> 04:35.000
Thank you for your hard work.

04:35.080 --> 04:37.040
The grand worship ceremony
concerns the nation's fate.

04:37.120 --> 04:39.400
It's quite challenging
to take on this task for the first time.

04:40.280 --> 04:42.520
Fortunately, I have your full support.

04:43.840 --> 04:45.080
Before the ceremony tomorrow,

04:46.120 --> 04:47.880
I will inspect each location again

04:49.160 --> 04:50.560
to ensure everything is perfect.

04:51.120 --> 04:53.320
We'll surely strive for excellence
and leave no room for error.

04:54.200 --> 04:55.040
All right.

05:03.960 --> 05:06.640
OUTSKIRTS OF THE CAPITAL

05:10.160 --> 05:12.920
Your Highness, someone from the capital
requests an audience.

05:13.000 --> 05:13.840
Let him in.

05:28.480 --> 05:29.640
You may all go.

05:31.400 --> 05:32.240
- Yes.
- Yes.

05:53.040 --> 05:55.520
Your earlier plan was excellent.

05:56.720 --> 05:58.760
Now, with my army pressing in,

05:59.280 --> 06:00.720
the capital is within our grasp.

06:02.200 --> 06:03.800
No wonder Wanning is so fond of you.

06:03.880 --> 06:05.040
Upon meeting today,

06:05.640 --> 06:08.200
you are indeed extraordinarily talented.

06:08.280 --> 06:09.320
Your Highness flatters me.

06:10.360 --> 06:14.440
Now, Your Highness only lacks
a just cause for launching the campaign.

06:15.000 --> 06:17.280
Do you have any brilliant ideas?

06:17.360 --> 06:21.240
That depends on how far Your Highness
is willing to go.

06:23.600 --> 06:25.120
The best justification for war

06:29.240 --> 06:31.880
would be to kill the Princess
and frame the Emperor.

06:40.160 --> 06:41.800
Aren't you afraid

06:41.880 --> 06:44.080
that I might kill you right now
for proposing such a plan?

06:44.160 --> 06:46.640
Your Highness has been stationed
at the northern border for years.

06:46.720 --> 06:48.440
Your success or failure
depends on this step.

06:49.040 --> 06:50.040
I trust that Your Highness

06:51.000 --> 06:53.400
is not a softhearted person.

07:03.080 --> 07:05.120
Wanning is, after all, my own sister.

07:06.880 --> 07:08.160
I can't bear to exchange her life

07:10.320 --> 07:11.280
for this.

07:15.360 --> 07:16.400
However,

07:18.680 --> 07:20.600
faking her death

07:22.320 --> 07:24.240
might be acceptable.

07:24.320 --> 07:26.160
So, Your Highness already has a plan?

07:28.480 --> 07:30.160
With your brilliance,

07:30.800 --> 07:33.760
the plan you propose
is certainly more thorough than mine.

07:35.320 --> 07:36.200
All right.

07:38.720 --> 07:39.720
The moment we do this,

07:41.880 --> 07:42.960
the Eldest Princess

07:43.600 --> 07:45.720
won't be able to appear before the public.

07:46.560 --> 07:47.960
But with her temperament,

07:48.600 --> 07:50.040
she certainly wouldn't agree to this.

07:50.520 --> 07:53.320
Therefore, I don't plan
to inform her in advance.

07:53.880 --> 07:57.160
When the time comes, I will have her take
the potion to fake her death

07:57.720 --> 07:58.960
and finish the act first.

07:59.640 --> 08:00.960
Once it's done,

08:01.040 --> 08:02.480
I ask that Your Highness intercede

08:03.280 --> 08:05.280
in front of Eldest Princess for me.

08:06.640 --> 08:07.880
My sister

08:09.080 --> 08:10.360
would never agree to something

08:10.440 --> 08:12.080
that would oppress her.

08:13.440 --> 08:14.320
Very well.

08:14.400 --> 08:16.440
If she blames you afterward,

08:17.080 --> 08:18.760
I will plead your case.

08:20.200 --> 08:21.200
Thank you, Your Highness.

08:22.440 --> 08:24.680
However, to help Your Highness
accomplish this,

08:25.200 --> 08:26.520
I'm boldly requesting

08:28.200 --> 08:29.400
one thing from you.

08:29.480 --> 08:30.960
What is it that you want?

08:36.679 --> 08:43.679
- Prince Cheng!
- Prince Cheng!

08:43.760 --> 08:50.040
- Prince Cheng!
- Prince Cheng!

08:50.120 --> 08:56.480
- Prince Cheng!
- Prince Cheng!

09:20.560 --> 09:23.280
Greetings, Your Majesty.

09:23.360 --> 09:24.840
Please rise.

09:25.360 --> 09:26.480
There's no need for courtesy.

09:27.560 --> 09:29.200
Your guarding of the north

09:29.280 --> 09:31.440
ensures the security
of Great Yan's border.

09:31.520 --> 09:33.480
If Father knows about this
in the afterlife,

09:33.560 --> 09:36.120
he would be pleased to see Great Yan
enjoying great stability.

09:37.880 --> 09:39.840
Serving you and the nation

09:39.920 --> 09:41.320
is my duty.

09:41.400 --> 09:43.160
Your Majesty's benevolent rule

09:43.240 --> 09:44.240
blesses the people.

09:45.040 --> 09:46.760
Great Yan's prosperity today

09:46.840 --> 09:49.240
is a result of Your Majesty's kindness
and love for all beings.

09:50.000 --> 09:51.720
I dare not claim credit.

09:51.800 --> 09:53.760
You don't claim credit
or become complacent.

09:54.920 --> 09:56.920
I will make sure to reward you generously.

09:57.480 --> 09:58.840
Eunuch Su.

10:02.400 --> 10:03.400
Edict!

10:06.760 --> 10:08.400
"By imperial decree,

10:08.480 --> 10:11.840
Prince Cheng Zhao Sheng
guards the northern border.

10:11.920 --> 10:13.480
He's loyal and diligent,

10:13.560 --> 10:14.760
contributing to the nation.

10:14.840 --> 10:17.440
He is rewarded
a Seven-Star Longyuan Sword,

10:17.520 --> 10:19.120
two chests of jewels,

10:19.200 --> 10:20.920
two golden and jade Buddhas,

10:21.000 --> 10:22.840
two Ancient Sea Night Pearls,

10:22.920 --> 10:24.880
and a pair of iron decree.

10:24.960 --> 10:26.480
That's all."

10:26.560 --> 10:27.720
Thank you, Your Majesty.

10:31.760 --> 10:33.440
You deserve all this.

10:48.520 --> 10:51.480
I also found twenty chests
of treasures in the north,

10:51.560 --> 10:53.640
and I present them to Your Majesty.

10:54.280 --> 10:56.680
I wish Your Majesty good health

10:56.760 --> 10:59.040
and wish Great Yan long-lasting peace.

10:59.120 --> 10:59.960
Excellent.

11:01.080 --> 11:02.080
You're very thoughtful.

11:03.080 --> 11:05.720
How about staying in the capital
after tomorrow's ceremony?

11:08.440 --> 11:11.400
If Father is looking at us from above,

11:11.480 --> 11:13.640
he wouldn't want you to be away
from home for long.

11:15.800 --> 11:16.640
Honestly,

11:17.200 --> 11:20.720
I plan to return to the north at once

11:20.800 --> 11:22.240
after tomorrow's grand worship ceremony.

11:23.640 --> 11:25.200
Although the border is peaceful now,

11:25.280 --> 11:28.280
we must take the situation
in the north seriously.

11:28.760 --> 11:29.880
In my absence,

11:29.960 --> 11:32.720
those from the Dai may cause trouble.

11:33.520 --> 11:35.160
I ask for Your Majesty's understanding.

11:35.720 --> 11:37.640
Great Yan is truly blessed
to have you, Zhao Sheng.

11:38.600 --> 11:39.440
This way, please.

11:39.960 --> 11:41.040
Your Majesty, after you.

12:20.200 --> 12:22.480
It has been a long time, Zhao Sheng.

12:23.760 --> 12:25.040
You've lost weight.

12:25.880 --> 12:27.440
It pains me to see you like this.

12:27.520 --> 12:29.440
During your absence from the capital,

12:29.520 --> 12:31.080
I've always been concerned about you.

12:31.600 --> 12:33.680
But you always ignored me.

12:34.880 --> 12:36.480
Don't you think that's out of line?

12:36.560 --> 12:37.480
Wanning,

12:38.760 --> 12:41.320
drop the act.

12:42.080 --> 12:43.000
Zhao Sheng,

12:43.560 --> 12:46.520
I've heard that His Majesty
gave you many rewards.

12:46.600 --> 12:47.440
Leave us.

12:48.040 --> 12:50.280
I want to talk
to the Eldest Princess alone.

12:56.120 --> 12:57.440
Those worldly possessions

12:58.400 --> 13:00.840
are just reminders of the Emperor's grace,

13:01.600 --> 13:04.040
telling me not to act recklessly.

13:04.600 --> 13:06.920
I've endured in the north
for so many years.

13:08.320 --> 13:10.560
I did not do it for those petty rewards.

13:10.640 --> 13:11.640
Zhao Sheng,

13:12.240 --> 13:13.920
are you planning to take action now?

13:14.720 --> 13:17.360
You were easily deceived
by a herb that could fake a pregnancy.

13:18.520 --> 13:20.200
Did pregnancy make you foolish?

13:21.280 --> 13:23.560
If we fail to maintain
a good relationship with Li Zhongnan,

13:25.160 --> 13:27.040
we can forget about our ambitions.

13:27.640 --> 13:30.560
Zhao Sheng, you are heroic
and exceptional now,

13:31.760 --> 13:33.760
so you even dare to blame me.

13:35.000 --> 13:37.040
It's as if you've forgotten

13:37.120 --> 13:39.320
how you fled the city
in disgrace back then.

13:41.360 --> 13:45.000
If it weren't for Xiao Minghan's
interference back then,

13:46.200 --> 13:48.000
the one sitting on the throne today

13:48.080 --> 13:50.080
wouldn't be Zhao Ye.

13:51.680 --> 13:53.560
A remarkable figure like Xiao Minghan

13:54.400 --> 13:57.440
surprisingly raised such a devoted son,

13:58.000 --> 14:00.600
who only loves his beautiful women,
but not power.

14:06.880 --> 14:08.240
Let's go pay respect to Mother.

14:11.080 --> 14:12.800
YONG'AN PAVILION

14:12.880 --> 14:17.240
MEMORIAL TABLET OF NOBLE CONSORT LIU

14:19.160 --> 14:20.360
Mother, wake up.

14:20.440 --> 14:23.360
Mother, I will behave in the future.

14:23.440 --> 14:24.520
Mother.

14:25.360 --> 14:27.320
Mother, you'll be fine.

14:27.920 --> 14:32.240
I don't come from a prestigious family,

14:33.480 --> 14:37.720
nor am I your father's favorite consort.

14:38.720 --> 14:40.200
Although I was given the title

14:41.040 --> 14:43.120
of Noble Consort
after giving birth to you,

14:43.200 --> 14:47.520
I still have to be cautious

14:48.600 --> 14:50.640
and vigilant all the time.

14:51.680 --> 14:53.240
I fear that a single misstep

14:54.560 --> 14:56.280
would lead to being plotted against.

14:58.400 --> 14:59.600
In this palace,

15:00.320 --> 15:02.760
I've seen coldness and malice

15:04.080 --> 15:05.760
and how heartless people can be.

15:06.560 --> 15:08.320
After I'm gone,

15:08.400 --> 15:10.960
you must support each other

15:11.600 --> 15:13.400
and take care of yourselves.

15:14.400 --> 15:15.800
Understand?

15:16.440 --> 15:17.720
Understood.

15:26.240 --> 15:28.240
Sheng'er. Jing'er.

15:28.760 --> 15:30.320
Remember.

15:31.040 --> 15:34.160
It's about survival of the fittest
in the palace.

15:35.280 --> 15:37.880
Only by competing can you survive.

15:39.360 --> 15:41.880
Only supreme imperial power

15:43.240 --> 15:45.760
can truly help you protect yourselves.

15:52.320 --> 15:53.440
Chancellor Li.

15:57.600 --> 15:58.960
Prince Cheng,

15:59.040 --> 16:00.040
Eldest Princess.

16:01.840 --> 16:03.200
Tell me your plans.

16:03.280 --> 16:05.880
The uprising will be
at tomorrow's evening banquet.

16:06.400 --> 16:08.400
We need to divide our forces into four.

16:12.400 --> 16:14.520
IMPERIAL PALACE

16:33.400 --> 16:35.760
You're wise, resourceful,
and toiled to give valuable service.

16:36.400 --> 16:38.800
I will definitely reward you generously.

16:38.880 --> 16:41.320
It's all thanks to the Eldest Princess'
strategic planning.

16:41.400 --> 16:43.280
Chancellor Li,
I know nothing about these things.

16:44.120 --> 16:45.920
Zhao Sheng,
let me introduce someone to you.

16:46.000 --> 16:47.800
Do you have a military adviser?

17:08.760 --> 17:09.599
Zhao Sheng,

17:10.200 --> 17:13.040
this is Shen Yurong,
whom I mentioned to you before.

17:15.359 --> 17:18.000
Greetings, Prince Cheng.

17:18.079 --> 17:19.920
Mr. Shen is wise and resourceful.

17:20.760 --> 17:22.560
Which rank are you currently at?

17:22.640 --> 17:24.720
Hanlin Academy scholar, fifth rank.

17:24.800 --> 17:27.440
My younger brother really doesn't know
how to judge people.

17:28.440 --> 17:29.280
Rest assured.

17:29.360 --> 17:33.800
After this is done,
I will ensure your success.

17:35.120 --> 17:36.960
Thank you, Your Majesty.

17:40.080 --> 17:42.040
Long live Your Majesty.

17:58.200 --> 17:59.760
IMPERIAL PALACE

18:03.680 --> 18:04.880
Is everything ready?

18:06.720 --> 18:07.840
I've waited for eight years.

18:08.360 --> 18:09.680
Finally, this day has come.

18:10.160 --> 18:12.040
It feels somewhat surreal though.

18:12.120 --> 18:13.000
Li,

18:13.720 --> 18:15.400
do you remember the question you asked me

18:15.480 --> 18:17.200
at the Court of Judicial Review's prison?

18:17.280 --> 18:18.600
I didn't answer that day.

18:18.680 --> 18:20.160
Now, ask me again.

18:22.240 --> 18:23.240
Duke Su,

18:24.360 --> 18:26.880
is there anyone around you
who died unjustly?

18:27.480 --> 18:28.320
Yes.

18:31.880 --> 18:34.080
My father led
the Longwu Army all his life,

18:35.640 --> 18:37.520
only to be abandoned outside the capital

18:37.600 --> 18:39.160
by Prince Cheng for his own gain,

18:39.240 --> 18:41.040
causing him to die at the border.

18:41.880 --> 18:44.320
I also beat the Admonishment Drum
outside the city gate for him.

18:45.360 --> 18:47.480
But I was incapable
of clearing his name at that time.

18:50.760 --> 18:52.480
In the past eight years,
I've been wondering.

18:54.520 --> 18:56.480
what exactly my father was thinking

18:57.520 --> 18:58.760
before his unjust death.

18:59.920 --> 19:01.320
Did he regret believing

19:01.400 --> 19:03.880
in such an ambitious
and treacherous person?

19:06.480 --> 19:09.200
My father also loved the people
like his own children.

19:10.760 --> 19:12.960
If General Xiao were still alive,

19:13.040 --> 19:15.280
they would surely
chat happily while drinking.

19:20.200 --> 19:21.120
Xiao Heng,

19:23.040 --> 19:24.560
you once told me

19:25.640 --> 19:27.400
to return and find out what happened,

19:27.480 --> 19:28.800
then move forward to seek justice.

19:29.720 --> 19:30.560
I've done that.

19:32.560 --> 19:34.360
The heavens is just, karma won't be good.

19:35.280 --> 19:36.360
I believe in the heavens.

19:36.880 --> 19:39.640
The late General Xiao
will bless you from above.

19:41.560 --> 19:43.120
You've never believed in the heavens.

19:44.880 --> 19:46.280
You only believe

19:47.200 --> 19:48.360
in yourself.

19:49.760 --> 19:50.600
No.

19:56.440 --> 19:57.800
I also believe in you.

20:03.240 --> 20:04.560
Please believe in me too.

20:05.640 --> 20:09.160
Prince Cheng framed loyal officials
and generals for his own selfish gain.

20:09.240 --> 20:11.360
Wanning tolerated corrupt officials

20:12.080 --> 20:13.640
for power.

20:14.280 --> 20:15.240
To them,

20:15.920 --> 20:17.400
the nation isn't about the people,

20:17.480 --> 20:18.440
but power.

20:19.520 --> 20:22.200
Be it the heavens or the people,
they won't be favored.

20:23.760 --> 20:24.600
Also,

20:30.880 --> 20:32.080
I won't abandon you

20:33.880 --> 20:34.880
no matter what.

21:01.320 --> 21:03.440
JIANG RESIDENCE

21:03.520 --> 21:07.600
This morning, Ruoyao sent me a letter.

21:08.360 --> 21:10.840
She said she's doing well in Yongzhou.

21:18.920 --> 21:19.880
This child

21:21.200 --> 21:23.040
also reminded me

21:23.120 --> 21:24.720
not to overwork myself

21:25.680 --> 21:28.680
and to delegate
household matters to Li'er.

21:30.640 --> 21:31.480
Seriously.

21:32.680 --> 21:33.520
Mother,

21:34.760 --> 21:37.280
I've been thinking a lot lately.

21:38.120 --> 21:40.760
If I didn't accept
the Chief Secretariat position

21:40.840 --> 21:42.400
from the late Emperor back then,

21:43.560 --> 21:45.360
would the Jiang family

21:45.960 --> 21:48.760
be in a different situation now?

21:54.960 --> 21:57.240
You are Ye'er's teacher.

21:58.000 --> 22:02.200
All his knowledge comes from you.

22:02.760 --> 22:06.120
His character
can truly benefit the people.

22:07.480 --> 22:08.480
Now,

22:10.320 --> 22:11.960
I'm about to place him

22:13.960 --> 22:16.720
in the most dangerous position.

22:18.760 --> 22:20.360
As for your position,

22:21.360 --> 22:22.280
I need

22:23.640 --> 22:25.320
to consider it too.

22:30.440 --> 22:32.560
I will follow your edict.

22:32.640 --> 22:35.560
I will appoint you
as the Chief Secretariat.

22:36.840 --> 22:38.160
After my death,

22:38.920 --> 22:40.640
make sure he grows up well

22:40.720 --> 22:42.000
and help him

22:43.760 --> 22:46.080
consolidate his imperial authority.

22:46.640 --> 22:47.480
Your Majesty,

22:48.960 --> 22:50.760
I actually…

22:54.280 --> 22:55.600
Accept it.

22:56.360 --> 22:57.800
Old man,

22:58.400 --> 23:00.960
continue your loyalty to me

23:02.840 --> 23:04.320
with him.

23:21.360 --> 23:22.240
Thank you,

23:23.720 --> 23:26.120
I will follow your command.

23:27.880 --> 23:29.760
It's lonely at the top.

23:29.840 --> 23:32.000
As the Chief Secretariat,

23:32.640 --> 23:34.640
if I fail to protect the young emperor

23:34.720 --> 23:36.440
and lead to a change in the throne,

23:37.160 --> 23:39.360
it will bring death upon me.

23:40.320 --> 23:41.920
If one becomes too domineering

23:42.000 --> 23:43.600
and makes the monarch wary,

23:44.440 --> 23:47.400
I will eventually die
a terrible death too.

23:48.160 --> 23:51.920
So, after His Majesty
could handle the state affairs himself,

23:52.000 --> 23:55.080
I deliberately loosened my grip,

23:55.680 --> 24:00.080
and let Li Zhongnan and others
have some power too.

24:00.920 --> 24:02.120
We criticized each other,

24:02.640 --> 24:04.040
but also covered for each other.

24:04.120 --> 24:06.320
It was all to stand firm and safely

24:06.400 --> 24:08.560
in this capital.

24:13.760 --> 24:15.520
I'm not blind

24:16.160 --> 24:20.480
to what was happening in the family.

24:21.320 --> 24:25.240
I just lacked the ability

24:25.320 --> 24:26.640
and time to deal with it.

24:27.840 --> 24:28.880
Besides other things,

24:29.560 --> 24:32.360
the younger generation at home

24:33.120 --> 24:34.360
ending up hurt

24:34.920 --> 24:36.480
or injured.

24:38.920 --> 24:41.480
It's all my fault.

24:43.560 --> 24:45.320
As long as you've realized it, it's fine.

24:46.360 --> 24:47.200
However,

24:48.360 --> 24:50.680
you suddenly brought up the matters
of the Imperial Court.

24:51.360 --> 24:53.680
Does Prince Cheng return to the capital

24:55.240 --> 24:56.320
with ill intentions?

25:05.640 --> 25:06.480
What would

25:07.960 --> 25:08.920
you do

25:10.280 --> 25:11.480
if he rebelled?

25:12.080 --> 25:14.680
I have long made a choice.

25:17.440 --> 25:19.880
The late Emperor entrusted me
with his legacy before he died.

25:20.680 --> 25:22.880
I won't let him down.

25:23.960 --> 25:26.680
I came here today

25:26.760 --> 25:28.840
to let you prepare in advance too.

25:29.400 --> 25:30.320
If I…

25:36.520 --> 25:39.760
If I become occupied,

25:40.600 --> 25:45.560
please take care
of the Jiang family for me.

25:50.200 --> 25:51.640
With me here,

25:53.440 --> 25:54.360
you can rest assured.

25:56.640 --> 25:57.760
It has been hard on you

25:59.480 --> 26:00.760
all these years.

26:03.600 --> 26:06.160
Seeing you like this now,

26:07.080 --> 26:08.720
I am reminded of someone.

26:09.960 --> 26:10.960
Who's that?

26:14.080 --> 26:15.640
My dear husband,

26:16.960 --> 26:20.920
your son
has finally inherited your spirit.

26:57.600 --> 26:59.080
Are you sure you heard it right?

26:59.160 --> 27:00.440
There's going to be a rebellion.

27:00.520 --> 27:01.760
How could I have misheard?

27:01.840 --> 27:02.760
Tell me,

27:03.560 --> 27:05.120
if Prince Cheng rebels,

27:05.200 --> 27:06.760
whose side should we be on?

27:07.720 --> 27:10.680
Prince Cheng's military achievements
in the north are illustrious

27:10.760 --> 27:13.480
and he commands a strong army.

27:13.560 --> 27:14.840
If a real conflict breaks out,

27:14.920 --> 27:16.600
His Majesty stands no chance.

27:17.280 --> 27:19.680
If His Majesty falls,

27:20.280 --> 27:23.280
the first to suffer
will be our Jiang family.

27:23.840 --> 27:25.600
- This won't do. Quickly pack up.
- What should we do?

27:25.680 --> 27:28.440
- Let's go to your maiden home to hide.
- He'd deal with the Jiang family?

27:30.240 --> 27:31.320
Hey.

27:32.000 --> 27:33.120
Start packing!

27:35.720 --> 27:37.680
TAIJI HALL

27:37.760 --> 27:38.760
Your Majesty,

27:38.840 --> 27:41.160
Vice Director Ye has everything ready.

27:41.240 --> 27:43.400
Tomorrow, Your Majesty will only
need to wake at 11 p.m.,

27:43.480 --> 27:46.040
depart from Taiji Hall at 3 a.m.,

27:46.120 --> 27:48.000
perform sacrificial rites at 11:45 a.m.,

27:48.080 --> 27:49.480
watch the military parade at 1 p.m.,

27:49.560 --> 27:51.600
and return to the palace
for the banquet at 7 p.m.

27:51.680 --> 27:52.840
Eunuch Su,

27:55.000 --> 27:56.280
how many years have you been with me?

27:56.360 --> 27:57.760
Since you ascended the throne,

27:58.720 --> 28:00.200
it has been over ten years.

28:00.280 --> 28:01.160
After tomorrow night,

28:02.360 --> 28:04.280
I will reward you handsomely

28:04.360 --> 28:05.720
if I'm still sitting on this chair.

28:07.720 --> 28:10.760
I only wish for Your Majesty's well-being.

28:12.880 --> 28:15.160
- Your Majesty, Consort Li…
- Your Majesty.

28:16.880 --> 28:18.160
I insisted on coming back.

28:18.240 --> 28:19.440
Eunuch Su, you may go first.

28:20.880 --> 28:22.760
Your Majesty, don't hide anything from me.

28:23.240 --> 28:25.520
Tomorrow, will Prince Cheng
and the others…

28:25.600 --> 28:28.280
Otherwise, why would you
suddenly want me to leave the palace?

28:28.360 --> 28:29.440
That's not true.

28:29.520 --> 28:31.560
Listen to me. Go first.

28:31.640 --> 28:32.760
I won't leave.

28:32.840 --> 28:34.520
I won't feel at ease if you don't go.

28:35.120 --> 28:36.840
If even I am gone,

28:37.480 --> 28:39.440
won't Prince Cheng become suspicious?

28:40.040 --> 28:41.520
I must stay.

28:41.600 --> 28:42.840
Do you know

28:43.720 --> 28:46.880
what it means to stay
at tomorrow night's banquet?

28:46.960 --> 28:48.200
It's precisely because I know

28:48.960 --> 28:51.120
that I want to stay by Your Majesty's side

28:51.200 --> 28:53.080
and face it with you together.

28:53.720 --> 28:54.920
I won't allow that.

28:55.520 --> 28:56.400
Your Majesty.

28:58.040 --> 29:01.320
Your Majesty, if I fall into enemy hands,

29:01.840 --> 29:02.840
I would rather die

29:03.320 --> 29:04.720
than bring trouble to Your Majesty.

29:06.120 --> 29:07.160
Dear.

29:21.880 --> 29:28.240
GOVERN PEOPLE, SERVE THE HEAVENS

29:29.320 --> 29:33.560
MEMORIAL TABLET OF EMPEROR LONGXIAO

29:33.640 --> 29:38.320
MEMORIAL TABLET OF EMPEROR LONGXIAO

29:39.280 --> 29:41.000
In January,

29:41.600 --> 29:43.520
with solemn ceremonies,

29:43.600 --> 29:46.400
we offer sacrifices and wine,

29:46.480 --> 29:48.680
respectfully presenting offerings
at the ancestral shrine

29:48.760 --> 29:51.640
to express our admiration and longing.

29:51.720 --> 29:54.240
Partake of this sacrifice.
Get into position to worship.

30:01.920 --> 30:05.040
Perform ablution, offer incense, and bow.

30:06.160 --> 30:08.360
Since Father passed this throne to me,

30:09.240 --> 30:10.160
no matter what,

30:11.000 --> 30:12.680
I won't allow anyone

30:13.320 --> 30:14.840
to take this position away from me.

30:14.920 --> 30:15.760
You old man,

30:16.320 --> 30:17.840
you must carefully watch

30:18.720 --> 30:21.640
who the true owner of this nation is.

30:28.520 --> 30:30.160
MEMORIAL TABLET OF EMPEROR LONGXIAO

30:30.240 --> 30:31.920
It reads!

30:33.880 --> 30:36.800
"The way of heaven is Yin and Yang.

30:36.880 --> 30:39.400
The way of the earth
is gentleness and firmness.

30:39.960 --> 30:43.000
The teachings of saints and sages,
reach heaven and earth.

30:43.080 --> 30:46.400
A bright light in the long night,
making day and night equal,

30:46.480 --> 30:48.280
achieving harmony under the heavens."

30:51.600 --> 30:52.760
You may all go.

30:53.320 --> 30:54.200
Yes.

30:56.200 --> 30:58.440
LATE EMPEROR

31:02.760 --> 31:03.640
Father.

31:06.720 --> 31:07.960
It's good

31:10.240 --> 31:11.560
that you're back.

31:12.120 --> 31:13.320
Are you comforting me

31:14.080 --> 31:15.440
or comforting yourself?

31:16.360 --> 31:18.280
Didn't you know
what kind of life I would have

31:19.200 --> 31:20.440
when you sent me to Dai

31:20.520 --> 31:21.760
as a hostage?

31:22.400 --> 31:24.360
I lived in a sheepfold every day,

31:24.440 --> 31:25.520
enduring humiliation,

31:26.200 --> 31:28.080
going hungry, barely clothed.

31:29.360 --> 31:30.200
Jing'er?

31:30.840 --> 31:31.960
A princess?

31:33.440 --> 31:34.280
Father,

31:34.960 --> 31:36.600
I wasn't even worthy of being a human.

31:37.680 --> 31:40.000
I'm just some dirt in the sheepfold.

31:40.720 --> 31:42.080
My Jing'er,

31:43.560 --> 31:45.040
you've suffered a lot.

31:46.960 --> 31:48.640
Truthfully, there was not a moment in Dai

31:49.400 --> 31:51.360
when I was not missing you.

31:52.520 --> 31:54.040
I fantasized daily that one day,

31:54.640 --> 31:56.840
you would come to Dai to bring me home.

31:58.360 --> 32:00.000
I fantasized every day

32:00.080 --> 32:01.680
that you would love, cherish, and hold me

32:01.760 --> 32:03.680
like you did when I was little.

32:06.880 --> 32:08.080
Your daughter has returned.

32:11.600 --> 32:13.560
Eldest Princess Wanning has returned.

32:14.040 --> 32:15.160
I have

32:17.920 --> 32:19.200
let you down.

32:20.200 --> 32:23.160
Father, I also want to ask you this.

32:24.240 --> 32:25.760
Aside from loving yourself

32:27.240 --> 32:28.360
and your son,

32:30.600 --> 32:33.240
- have you ever loved me?
- Jing'er, stop.

32:34.920 --> 32:37.520
When they made such demands back then,

32:38.080 --> 32:41.120
they put me in a difficult position.

32:43.040 --> 32:45.440
- I had no choice.
- Father.

32:45.520 --> 32:47.160
I asked

32:48.720 --> 32:50.080
if you have ever loved me.

33:05.480 --> 33:06.440
Father,

33:08.280 --> 33:09.440
you should take your medicine.

33:19.200 --> 33:20.200
After taking the medicine,

33:21.000 --> 33:22.360
you will recover.

33:35.560 --> 33:36.840
The pillow is dirty.

33:38.560 --> 33:39.600
Let me change it for you.

33:41.440 --> 33:42.280
Come on.

33:42.360 --> 33:43.920
Jing'er.

34:23.239 --> 34:24.280
Father.

34:24.760 --> 34:26.600
you were the one who did me wrong first.

34:27.159 --> 34:30.120
All of you owe me this.

34:48.960 --> 34:51.679
I heard that your army in the north
is incredibly brave

34:51.760 --> 34:52.960
and renowned far and wide.

34:53.040 --> 34:55.320
People lined the road
in welcoming you into the capital.

34:55.400 --> 34:58.440
With the army in the north, Great Yan
can continue thriving for generations.

34:58.520 --> 35:00.080
It's all thanks to Your Majesty's support.

35:00.160 --> 35:03.240
We're one, be it the army in the north
or the army in the Central Plains.

35:03.840 --> 35:04.880
There is no distinction.

35:07.160 --> 35:08.600
Zhao Sheng, go back and rest for a while.

35:09.120 --> 35:11.320
Let's drink to our heart's content
at the banquet tonight.

35:23.200 --> 35:27.480
XUANWU GATE

35:27.560 --> 35:28.480
Duke Su.

35:34.880 --> 35:36.640
It has been almost nine years
since we last met.

35:37.360 --> 35:38.960
I can't believe you're this tall now.

35:39.560 --> 35:41.280
I remember when I left the capital,

35:41.840 --> 35:43.160
you were only this tall.

35:43.240 --> 35:45.560
If your parents were still alive,

35:46.160 --> 35:47.840
they would be glad to see

35:48.720 --> 35:50.240
you how you'd turned out now.

35:50.320 --> 35:52.200
My father had bad luck

35:52.280 --> 35:54.040
and couldn't survive on the battlefield.

35:55.320 --> 35:57.280
If he could see your achievements now,

35:57.880 --> 35:59.440
he would also be very pleased.

36:06.000 --> 36:08.160
I have to thank General Xiao.

36:09.120 --> 36:12.320
If he hadn't come to my rescue
from the south back then,

36:13.160 --> 36:15.160
I wouldn't have been able to make amends

36:15.240 --> 36:16.320
and reclaim lost territory.

36:17.160 --> 36:18.360
It's a pity.

36:19.600 --> 36:21.360
He died from multiple arrow wounds

36:22.000 --> 36:23.680
in the valley.

36:24.840 --> 36:26.240
I'm also

36:27.760 --> 36:29.320
deeply saddened by it.

36:29.920 --> 36:31.520
It's all history.

36:31.600 --> 36:32.840
There's no need to bring it up.

36:32.920 --> 36:34.440
Master wouldn't listen to advice.

36:35.120 --> 36:36.920
I told him not to pursue a desperate foe.

36:37.520 --> 36:39.200
He clearly had a chance to turn back.

36:40.440 --> 36:42.280
But he insisted on going to the end.

36:43.640 --> 36:45.040
It's truly regrettable.

36:47.640 --> 36:48.520
I hope

36:49.440 --> 36:50.760
you won't repeat

36:50.840 --> 36:52.720
my master's mistakes.

36:52.800 --> 36:54.760
I don't like taking risks.

36:55.680 --> 36:57.840
Stability is the most important thing.

36:58.920 --> 37:00.480
Why give yourself a hard time?

37:00.560 --> 37:01.920
At the banquet,

37:02.480 --> 37:04.920
I will humbly seek advice from you again.

37:05.480 --> 37:09.120
I hope to see you again later.

37:10.720 --> 37:11.600
Of course.

37:29.640 --> 37:32.640
Fate has never been kind to me
since I was young.

37:34.200 --> 37:37.000
As they say, surviving a great calamity
brings great fortune.

37:37.720 --> 37:39.200
I escaped death once before.

37:40.240 --> 37:41.840
If there's good fortune to come,

37:42.960 --> 37:46.040
please give that fortune to Xiao Heng.

37:54.360 --> 37:55.720
DUKE SU'S MANSION

38:00.160 --> 38:03.000
You guys, watch at the west courtyard.
You guys, go to the east courtyard.

38:03.080 --> 38:03.920
- Yes!
- Yes!

38:07.000 --> 38:08.360
Is something going to happen?

38:08.920 --> 38:10.120
Why is the mansion heavily guarded?

38:10.760 --> 38:12.080
Mr. Xue, please rest assured.

38:12.160 --> 38:13.400
It's just a regular drill here

38:13.480 --> 38:14.320
as a precaution.

38:20.440 --> 38:21.960
Are my sister and the others all right?

38:23.760 --> 38:24.680
Don't keep it from me.

38:25.440 --> 38:27.040
With your actions, you can't fool me.

38:27.120 --> 38:28.680
You only need to stay in the mansion.

38:29.160 --> 38:30.640
We've made arrangements for Ms. Xue.

38:30.720 --> 38:32.760
There are secret guards
both in and out of the mansion.

38:32.840 --> 38:34.560
Nothing will happen to you.

38:35.640 --> 38:36.480
Let's go!

38:43.120 --> 38:44.360
I'll be counting on you tonight.

38:44.840 --> 38:45.680
Don't worry.

38:46.160 --> 38:47.360
Duke Su already made arrangements.

38:47.440 --> 38:49.200
Secret guards will guard
outside Jiang Residence.

39:03.480 --> 39:04.320
Mr. Jiang.

39:04.400 --> 39:06.400
I was just looking for you. Zhao Ke.

39:06.480 --> 39:08.040
I was away for a few days, right?

39:08.120 --> 39:09.760
No one took care of the plants
in the garden.

39:09.840 --> 39:12.000
I noticed that one of them
had some issues earlier.

39:12.080 --> 39:13.520
Can you go over and take a look?

39:14.600 --> 39:18.200
Old Madam called for me
because she needed something.

39:18.760 --> 39:20.880
I can't get you
to do anything for me right now, can I?

39:24.280 --> 39:25.120
I'll go with you.

39:25.680 --> 39:27.040
Look at this.

39:27.120 --> 39:29.120
A perfectly good plant
wilted just like this.

39:29.200 --> 39:30.040
It's such a shame.

39:30.120 --> 39:32.200
This is the only memento
my mother has for me.

39:32.280 --> 39:33.760
You must help me save it.

39:37.840 --> 39:39.320
I think I smell something rotten.

39:39.880 --> 39:41.400
Are the roots rotting inside?

39:41.480 --> 39:42.360
Take a sniff.

39:42.440 --> 39:43.600
Based on its appearance,

39:43.680 --> 39:45.960
it's probably been exposed
to the sun for too long.

39:46.040 --> 39:47.520
I'll move it to a shady spot,

39:47.600 --> 39:49.280
water it regularly, and fertilize it.

39:49.840 --> 39:51.320
It should revive in a few days.

39:51.800 --> 39:53.000
No, that's not it.

39:53.080 --> 39:54.960
The roots must be rotting.
Come closer and smell.

39:55.040 --> 39:56.480
Come over and smell it.

39:57.040 --> 39:59.680
Mr. Jiang, Old Madam
is still waiting for me.

39:59.760 --> 40:01.280
I need to go now.

40:04.440 --> 40:05.280
Zhao Ke!

40:38.760 --> 40:40.640
My lady, here's a letter
from the Duke's Mansion.

40:48.880 --> 40:50.800
COME TO DUKE'S MANSION AT ONCE
TO DISCUSS URGENT MATTERS

40:50.880 --> 40:52.680
My lady, could something have happened?

40:53.360 --> 40:55.360
Duke Su asked me to go to his mansion,

40:56.240 --> 40:57.560
saying there are
urgent matters to discuss.

40:58.840 --> 41:00.320
Why is he asking to meet at this time?

41:01.200 --> 41:03.240
Maybe you should go tomorrow instead.

41:03.320 --> 41:04.720
At a moment like this,

41:05.360 --> 41:06.600
he must have urgent matters

41:06.680 --> 41:07.640
to discuss with me.

41:10.000 --> 41:12.480
Baixue, leave for now.

41:12.560 --> 41:13.400
Yes.

41:29.560 --> 41:31.040
Accompany me to the Duke's Mansion.

41:31.840 --> 41:32.680
Yes.

42:29.320 --> 42:31.440
Could something have happened
to my father and Xue Zhao?

42:36.960 --> 42:39.280
Zhao Ke, how long until we arrive?

42:39.360 --> 42:40.960
Ms. Jiang Li, we'll arrive in 15 minutes.

42:45.840 --> 42:47.280
Ms. Jiang Li?

42:47.360 --> 42:48.840
My lady, do you have any instructions?

42:49.400 --> 42:50.240
My lady.

42:59.360 --> 43:00.640
Could it be that this Zhao Ke…

43:03.320 --> 43:04.160
Zhao Ke,

43:05.440 --> 43:08.080
you usually deliver the letters
from the Duke's Mansion.

43:08.680 --> 43:10.080
Why did you give it to Baixue today?

43:10.640 --> 43:12.400
I was tidying the garden in the afternoon.

43:12.880 --> 43:14.720
Maybe the messenger couldn't find me.

43:17.240 --> 43:18.280
He's indeed suspicious.

43:20.600 --> 43:21.440
Stop the carriage.

43:29.640 --> 43:30.760
Come on, watch your step.

43:34.920 --> 43:37.120
Zhao Ke, wait here.

43:37.200 --> 43:38.080
I'll go buy something.

43:42.200 --> 43:43.920
It seems like you've seen through me.

43:47.720 --> 43:49.200
Let me go! Help!

43:49.840 --> 43:50.680
Save me!

43:53.840 --> 43:54.920
Help!

43:57.040 --> 43:57.880
Let me go!

43:58.880 --> 43:59.720
Let me go!

45:02.920 --> 45:06.360
How does it feel to be here again?

45:07.680 --> 45:08.640
Who is he?

45:20.160 --> 45:21.520
Nobody ever saw through

45:21.600 --> 45:23.440
his voice mimicking and disguise before.

45:24.800 --> 45:25.920
But you…

45:28.560 --> 45:30.080
are pretty impressive.

45:33.240 --> 45:34.880
Why did you capture me now?

45:36.360 --> 45:37.280
To settle the score

45:37.360 --> 45:38.960
of you faking my pregnancy, of course.

45:40.080 --> 45:42.480
But I can wait until Xiao Heng arrives,

45:43.920 --> 45:47.040
so he can watch with me
how things end for you.

45:47.960 --> 45:48.800
What do you think?

45:49.480 --> 45:51.040
He even handed over the Longwu Army.

45:52.480 --> 45:54.360
He's no longer a threat
to all of you anymore.

45:54.440 --> 45:56.560
Why can't you just leave him alone?

45:57.320 --> 45:59.280
You're in a perilous situation yourself.

46:00.000 --> 46:01.560
Yet you're still worried about him.

46:02.680 --> 46:04.200
Your love for each other

46:04.280 --> 46:06.920
really moves me.

46:08.440 --> 46:10.080
Do you know what it's like to lose a baby?

46:10.160 --> 46:11.800
Do you know how painful it is

46:11.880 --> 46:13.280
to have one's hopes shattered?

46:16.240 --> 46:17.200
I don't.

46:17.920 --> 46:21.560
But I do know what it feels like
to be buried alive by someone

46:21.640 --> 46:22.640
I loved and trusted.

46:22.720 --> 46:24.040
Xue Fangfei.

46:25.320 --> 46:27.720
Sometimes, I quite like you.

46:28.880 --> 46:30.400
If it weren't for Shen Yurong,

46:31.000 --> 46:32.680
we really could have been friends.

46:34.200 --> 46:35.760
I'll never be friends

46:36.560 --> 46:38.080
with someone as disgusting as you.

46:39.720 --> 46:41.560
I know you're trying to provoke me.

46:42.240 --> 46:43.840
But before Xiao Heng arrives,

46:43.920 --> 46:45.800
I won't lay a finger on you.

46:45.880 --> 46:48.600
Because I want to see
both of you suffer together.

46:49.760 --> 46:50.840
Did you call me disgusting?

46:51.920 --> 46:53.320
If you were in my shoes,

46:54.040 --> 46:55.760
you might be even more ruthless.

46:56.960 --> 46:58.960
You and Shen Yurong
are truly a perfect match.

47:00.200 --> 47:02.600
You use the same excuse
to justify yourselves.

47:07.920 --> 47:09.520
That's why I like him.

47:10.480 --> 47:13.280
I finally dragged your once-clean husband

47:13.360 --> 47:15.320
into the quagmire with me.

47:16.360 --> 47:18.360
He's supposed to be like me to begin with.
